.githooks/* text eol=lf

# Shell scripts and the Dockerfile are executed, not read. A stray CRLF turns every
# line into "command: not found" on the production host, and these run the deploy
# and the backup. This repo is edited on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which
# normalises to LF on commit today, but that is a machine setting rather than a
# guarantee - pin it here instead.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
